<p>    -			 March     Feb----(Prev)   March96</p>
<p> Total Private	    140.5    140.6    140.8    135.5</p>
<p> -Goods-Producing	 112.7    112.7    112.6    109.5</p>
<p> --Manufacturing	  107.4    106.9    106.8    105.2</p>
<p> -Service-Producing     153.0    153.2    153.4    147.2</p>
