<p>    -			 March  February--(Prev)  March96</p>
<p> Total Non-Farm	 121,450  121,275  121,309  118,750</p>
<p> Goods-Producing	 24,501   24,513   24,498   24,196</p>
<p> -Construction	    5,616    5,643    5,644    5,341</p>
<p> -Manufacturing	  18,315   18,299   18,284   18,281</p>
<p> --Durable Goods	 10,759   10,744   10,735   10,623</p>
<p> --Non-Durable Goods    7,556    7,555    7,549    7,658</p>
<p>Number of Workers by Industry, Seasonally Adj. (1,000s):</p>
<p>    -			 March  February--(Prev)  March96</p>
